  m_Name: Incorrect use of recycling bins (cardboard placed in the plastic waste
    bin)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  hazardName: Incorrect use of recycling bins (cardboard placed in the plastic waste
    bin)
  description: Incorrect use of recycling bins (especially mixing waste types such
    as cardboard and plastic) leads to increased environmental and operational risks.
    Placing cardboard waste in plastic bins reduces the efficiency of the recycling
    process and may also cause disorder and contamination in the work area; therefore,
    each type of waste must be disposed of in the correct bin.
